# Axiomatic Plan

## Purpose / Summary
Create one single orbital factory (or a dormant network of Starship tankers that can be activated in under 90 days) that begins mass-producing $100–150/person, backpack-portable, fully-inflatable, gravity-fed, indefinite-life-support kits capable of sustaining every human on Mars indefinitely using only Martian CO₂, water-ice, sunlight, and gravity after sol 60.
Kits are pre-landed with every uncrewed cargo flight starting 2031.
Success = No human on Mars ever dies of starvation, dehydration, or O₂ depletion — no matter how many ships are lost or how long Earth comms are down.
Total cost for 1 million humans < cost of three orbital refueling flights.

